        "text_UK9cU7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>How much I've spent trying to fix this:</h2><ul><li>Posture brace: $35</li><li>Cervical pillow: $50</li><li>8 chiropractor visits: $750</li><li>Neck cream (don't judge me): $25</li><li>Total spent on things that didn't work: $860</li></ul><p><em>QuestProps costs $139. Once</em>. No refills. No appointments. No subscriptions.</p><p>That's less than 3 chiropractor visits. Less than what you've probably already spent on things sitting in a drawer right now.</p><p>And unlike everything else I tried: <strong>180-day money-back guarantee.</strong> If you don't see your neck changing in the mirror, you send it back. Full refund.</p><p>You either get results or you get your money back. That's it.</p>",
